### `aitm remove <toolId>`

Remove a tool from the manifest, lock file, and delete its installed file(s) from disk. The `<toolId>` is the key used in the `tools` section of `aitools.json`.

```bash
aitm remove group/project/path/to/file.md
```

| Argument | Description |
|---|---|
| `<toolId>` | The tool identifier (key in the manifest `tools` object) |

